","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":34,"title":{"value":"L'incontro con Ophanimon","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The digidestined decide to free Ophanimon once and for all, but Cherubimon ends up being her guard. Can they find a way to free her from the final of the 3 guardian Digimon?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-12-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aPRI0AtplCNSPBZ3w6WXOaGixdq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aPRI0AtplCNSPBZ3w6WXOaGixdq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/34"},{"id":"1869341","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":35,"title":{"value":"Il vero Kerpymon","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takuya and Koji must hold off Cherubimon while the others free Ophanimon, but can they succeed when they lose their spirits?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-12-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4xx7do78sIRY9QQbFzmnUObp24f.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4xx7do78sIRY9QQbFzmnUObp24f.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/35"},{"id":"1869343","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":36,"title":{"value":"Il combattimento con IceDevimon","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Cherubimon appears to be defeated, but he appears to be easy compared to IceDevimon. Can the others find a way to defeat IceDevimon with Takuya and Koji's D-Tectors frozen solid?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-12-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hJJ1UDyguGc08AFjMvO1AiYnqHc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hJJ1UDyguGc08AFjMvO1AiYnqHc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/36"},{"id":"1869344","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":37,"title":{"value":"La fine di Kerpymon","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The final battle between EmperorGreymon/ MagnaGarurumon and Cherubimon begins, but who will end up being the victor, and who are these mysterious characters that are watching the battle?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2002-12-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mxxoqe3RpNhAWXvBRvpLBjIRRFu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mxxoqe3RpNhAWXvBRvpLBjIRRFu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/37"},{"id":"1869345","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":38,"title":{"value":"I Cavalieri Reali","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Royal Knights appears and reveal that Lucemon will return. Can the digi-destined find a way to prevent this chaos from occuring,or will they be delaying the inevitable?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-01-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qG1eyZV8mKXMssV1xjmvGWhK1p0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qG1eyZV8mKXMssV1xjmvGWhK1p0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/38"},{"id":"1869346","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":39,"title":{"value":"Bloccati sulla luna","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After waking up on the moon, the digi-destined decide to try to get back to the digital world to get revenge on the Royal Knights, but will they succeed, or will they be stuck on the moon for the rest of their lives?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-01-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6RcVC8k6i8dlrWugCGkSpziK9gI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6RcVC8k6i8dlrWugCGkSpziK9gI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/39"},{"id":"1869349","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":40,"title":{"value":"Un incontro inatteso","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The digidestined run into the same group of kids that pusked Tommy onto the train causing him to come into the digital world, but can Tommy get past his resentment of them and save the day?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-01-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tihXq22stUgZxEF6CwEq6I0ZpCg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tihXq22stUgZxEF6CwEq6I0ZpCg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/40"},{"id":"1869353","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":41,"title":{"value":"Il villaggio del Fagiolo Gigante","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Katshuhara and company have been captured by the Royal Knights. It's a good thing for them that Tommy is with them, but can they find a way to save Beanstalk Village, and can the other kids get Worm the Trailmon to want to help out?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-01-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5rsG0MMXHYJBIcyemIRx60eIsSL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5rsG0MMXHYJBIcyemIRx60eIsSL.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/41"},{"id":"1869356","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":42,"title":{"value":"Salvate le Digiuova!","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When the Royal Knights target the Village og Beginnings for their next assault, it's up to the kids to convience the Trailmon to save the digi-eggs, but can they finally defeat the Royal Knights? Maybe they can with help from some old enemies.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-02-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/duw56th5lWrJHIeIxbPzt5a8KoF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/duw56th5lWrJHIeIxbPzt5a8KoF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/42"},{"id":"1869358","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":43,"title":{"value":"Scontro alla Città del Fuoco","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The kids rush to try and save the Flame Terminal from being deleted, but with the SkullSatamon already on hand, can they find a way to defeat them? Is there any way to unite all the Digimon to fight together?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-02-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kIDgy30E0AIbDKAvcChuSTh2Bk8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kIDgy30E0AIbDKAvcChuSTh2Bk8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/43"},{"id":"1869364","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":44,"title":{"value":"Il ritorno di Gotsumon","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With only 3 areas left to protect in the digital world, the digi-destined must act fast to save the forest terminal. EmperorGreymon and MagnaGarurumon seem to be getting stronger, but will they finally be able to defeat the Royal Knights?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-02-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ySx4v6YRqa1VVnViOKV8IVfXPGK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ySx4v6YRqa1VVnViOKV8IVfXPGK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/44"},{"id":"1869366","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":45,"title":{"value":"Alla difesa dell'Elettromercato di Akiba","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Only 2 areas of the digital world remain: The Autumn Leaf Fair and Ophanimon's castle, but can the kids find a way to save The Fair without losing any more digimon friends, or is the digital world truly done for?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-02-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/61QgX5Klo3FUDWuVMQrkxP5h6Xt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/61QgX5Klo3FUDWuVMQrkxP5h6Xt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/45"},{"id":"1869367","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":46,"title":{"value":"Lucemon si rivela","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The digi-destined arrive at Ophanimon's castle to try and save the last bit of data from being given to Lucemon. Can they finally defeat the Royal Knights, or will Lucemon be reborn?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-03-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7ZlfTXK58qs2hVZvhWMpAsJvItu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ZlfTXK58qs2hVZvhWMpAsJvItu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/46"},{"id":"1869368","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":47,"title":{"value":"Il destino dei Cavalieri Reali","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The final battle with the Royal Knights is about to occur, but who will win this surprising bout?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2003-03-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/74d8QTXmf200I2oPCvkquUSzGit.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/74d8QTXmf200I2oPCvkquUSzGit.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/8991/season/1/episode/47"},{"id":"1869369","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":48,"title":{"value":"Il sacrificio di Koichi","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Since Emperor Greymon and MagnaGarurumon proved to be too weak, the kids decide to try a multi attack, but will it be enough, or will they need additional power?","language":"en-US"},"air